e meaning is the same.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Connections that do not complete a handshake inside 30 seconds are dropped.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"A connection not established within 30 seconds being dropped is the same as being abandoned.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The relay allows a response 120 seconds to arrive before it times out.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Waiting up to 120 seconds for a response matches allowing 120 seconds before timing out.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"At most 512 connections may be held open concurrently.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"At most 512 concurrent open connections is the same limit as the claim.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The relay makes up to 3 further attempts after a request fails.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Up to 3 further attempts after failure equals being retried up to 3 times.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-007\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The relay will not negotiate any protocol version below TLS 1.2.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Refusing to negotiate versions below TLS 1.2 means rejecting anything older than TLS 1.2.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-008\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Access log records are emitted one JSON object per line.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"One JSON object per line means every access log line is a single JSON object.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-009\",\"verdict\":\"PARTIAL\",\"evidence\":\"The endpoint /-/healthy answers health checks.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The endpoint is stated to answer health checks, but the text does not say it reports liveness specifically as opposed to readiness or general health.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-001\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Vandrell Relay is a fictional HTTP relay.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states this verbatim.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-002\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The relay's default listen port is 8443.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The default listen port is stated as 8443.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Connections that do not complete a handshake inside 30 seconds are dropped.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The 30-second limit for completing a connection handshake is the connect timeout.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The relay allows a response 120 seconds to arrive before it times out.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The 120-second wait for a response before timing out is the read timeout.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-005\",\"verdict\":\"PARTIAL\",\"evidence\":\"At most 512 connections may be held open concurrently.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The 512 concurrent connection limit is stated, but the text does not say it is a default rather than a fixed limit.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-006\",\"verdict\":\"PARTIAL\",\"evidence\":\"The relay makes up to 3 further attempts after a request fails.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Up to 3 retry attempts per failed request is stated, but the text does not say this value is a default.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-007\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The relay will not negotiate any protocol version below TLS 1.2.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Not negotiating below TLS 1.2 makes TLS 1.2 the oldest version negotiated.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-008\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Access log records are emitted one JSON object per line.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"One JSON object per line is the JSON Lines format.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-009\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Access log records are emitted one JSON object per line.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Records are emitted one per line.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The endpoint /-/healthy answers health checks.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The endpoint that answers health checks is the one health checks should target.\"}]}","ttft_ms":13177,"type":"result","duration_ms":13214,"uuid":"f580c208-c63b-48db-8fb7-8ea3c0c622ee","ttft_stream_ms":1327,"time_to_request_ms":119,"first_content_frame_ms":1327,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
